 arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186414184 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ee7bcb0-cbaf-5352-92b0-cd166136549a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414160} {:answer/id #uuid "4c9f17f4-9dc8-5361-a789-bdbc15bc853f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414163} {:answer/id #uuid "584317fd-30c4-5e13-a6b5-997c0e64fc09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414165} {:answer/id #uuid "5995deb2-fa58-566a-aaf9-2112bbd190f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414167} {:answer/id #uuid "80f48683-4475-5276-86de-70b5aaa6717e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414172}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1ee7bcb0-cbaf-5352-92b0-cd166136549a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414160} :answer-field/id #uuid "b7896c9b-7e0a-54c6-99f6-7e5e3f97a0cf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414182}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "66e690c7-cd96-576d-8320-9b08eb6ce160" :question/math-academy-id "q-73741" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 